    {
      "id": 233350,
      "name": "cnranger",
      "username": "cnranger",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-08-04T16:39:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Got my tracking number on 7/31. Original delivery date was yesterday 8/3 which was promptly missed, it was never even marked as on the delivery truck. New delivery date is today, finger's crossed.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Edit: It did show up yesterday! I only order the Jagged Earth Expansion with the Promo Pack no other addons. Played a game with my son using Vengeance and Stone. It was a blast!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A bit of confussion when we used the new pressence colors and ended up with an extra one, since in the base game you always used every pressence token, we decided it must be an extra token. Let me know if that is not the case.</p>\n<p>This is now a two box game, no way this all fits in the base game box. Still deciding on how best to split contents between the two boxes.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:09.360Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 20131,
      "topic_slug": "jagged-earth-is-in-the-wild",
      "display_username": "cnranger",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
