      "created_at": "2020-08-07T16:09:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Aaahhh I checked my e-mail and I've had one (sent at 13:37 today, lol cool :D) which includes such information as...</p>\n<p>\"We are acting as the order fulfilment agent for <b>Greater Than Games</b> and are soon to dispatch your order.<br>\n<br>\nPlease ensure any address changes are provided to Spiral Galaxy via the Webform by Monday 10th August to avoid any issues with your shipment. If your information is correct there is no need to contact us. We hope you all have a fantastic weekend!<br>\n<br>\nYour will receive another email confirming when the order has been dispatched.\"</p>\n<p>Much wootage! I mean, I won't be able to really play it with anyone till I-don't-know-when, but woohoo anyway :P.</p>",
